  "technical_findings": [
    "Kumo Anomaly original .pth metadata publisher reports three allowlist-style pickle global imports (OrderedDict, torch.FloatStorage, torch._utils._rebuild_tensor_v2), not proof of safe unpickling; older SDK used weights_only=False; newer NVIDIA structured-data-models uses weights_only=True for same LFS hash",
    "ColorCode is a plain Conv3D stem plus six bottleneck residual blocks and trains on triangular color code noise d=T=13",
    "SurfaceCode is four plain same-padded 3D convolutions channels 4->128->128->128->4, kernel3, receptive field9. Bias-inclusive source-derived parameter count 912772 and fp16 1,826,360-byte file are size-compatible",
    "Both QEC checkpoint contents are gated 401 to anonymous reads; public API file hashes do not establish actual tensor inspection or personal authorization"
